{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57215","headline":"谶 四 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"震旦虽阔无别路，（震旦者，唐国也。\n无别路者，唯有一心之法，让大师化导如此也。\n）要假侄（《古尊宿语录》、《五灯会元》作「儿」）孙脚下（《天圣广灯录》作「上」）行。\n（侄孙者，今时传法弟子也）金鸡解衔一颗米（《古尊宿语录》、《五灯会元》作「一粒粟」，金鸡者，金州也，让师是金州人也。\n一颗米者，意取道一，江西马祖名道一。\n）供养十方（《古尊宿语录》）作「什邡」）罗汉僧。\n（让和尚付与道一，故言供养。\n十方者，马和尚是汉州十方县罗汉寺出家也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}